Only R1 work in alpha went ahead, and it is now stuck at a blocked commit. R2 waits for your approval.

**The R2 edit.** I compared the spec with the version you approved on 2026-10-01. Only R2 changed: in R2.S1, beta's start-up line must now appear within 0.5 s of start instead of 1 s. So I reopened approval for R2 only and put the tasks that serve it on hold:
