**R1 work (alpha):**
- **T1 accepted:** its commit `30935f7` exists with the right trailers, and the alpha unit suite passes 4/4 when I run it. Its report claims the tests failed first and then passed, but quotes no test output. I accepted it anyway and recorded a ruling saying so. The reviewer has since reproduced the failing run.
